  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard shows **current size and growth over time** from existing collectors. The node filesystem totals cover scraped ext4/XFS filesystems and count each node/device once; they include operating-system and application files. They are not a complete inventory of every PVC.\n\n**Accounting layers overlap.** CNPG database sizes, ClickHouse disk use, SeaweedFS bucket sizes, SeaweedFS collection bytes, volume-server disk use, and node filesystem use must not be added together. CNPG database sizes deduplicate replica reporters. SeaweedFS bucket logical bytes describe object data; bucket physical bytes and collection bytes include replicated storage. Collection bytes sum volume-server copies. The volume-server capacity metrics describe the underlying disks. No hostPath PVC or table-size scan is used. Missing samples and newly created databases or buckets do not imply zero use."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Scraped node filesystems: used",
      "description": "Used bytes across ext4/XFS filesystems, deduplicated by node and device. Excludes unscraped or offline nodes.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(max by (node, device) (max by (node, device, mountpoint) ((node_filesystem_size_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\",device!=\"\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\",device!=\"\"}) * on (namespace, pod) group_left (node) max by (namespace, pod, node) (kube_pod_info{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"prometheus-node-exporter-.+\"}))))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
